From: Uke platform maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] backlight: adopt the Uke paired normal brightness path

Use the exact GPL OEM normal curve and preserve the inherited KTZ8866
GPIO, bias, sink and ramp setup. Expose one native backlight for both
controllers, verify changes and restore both snapshots after any error.
Probe and unbind do not write firmware brightness or panel power settings.
The primary holds a managed dependency on the exact secondary endpoint.
HBM and suspend policy remain separate.

